  "html": "<div class=\"pg-page pg-role-summary\" data-pg-theme=\"workbench\" data-pg-scroll=\"fit\" data-pg-role=\"summary\" data-pg-title=\"留数定理速查：算之前先问三个问题\">\n<header class=\"pg-head\">\n<p class=\"pg-eyebrow\">第 3 讲 · 小结</p>\n<h1 class=\"pg-title\">留数定理速查：算之前先问三个问题</h1>\n<p class=\"pg-lede\">把围道积分的判断压成三步：找奇点、判内外、求和乘 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi i</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>\n<ul class=\"pg-meta\">\n<li>小结</li>\n<li>约 6 分钟</li>\n<li>对应大题 15</li>\n<li>复变函数攻略 · 3.3</li>\n</ul>\n</header>\n<nav class=\"pg-outline\" aria-label=\"本页路线\">\n<p class=\"pg-outline-label\">本页路线</p>\n<ol>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b1\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">01</span>\n<span>一句话主线</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b2\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">02</span>\n<span>留数定理</span>\n</button></li>\n<li><button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-outline-link\" data-pg-action=\"goto\" data-pg-goto=\"b3\">\n<span class=\"pg-outline-index\">03</span>\n<span>奇点处理速查</span>\n</button></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<main class=\"pg-flow\">\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-callout pg-callout-key\" data-mp-block=\"b1\" aria-label=\"一句话主线\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">核心</p>\n<h2>一句话主线</h2>\n<p>围道积分只看圈内奇点：先标奇点、再判内外，只对圈内奇点求留数，求和乘 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi i</annotation></semantics></math></span>，最后检查曲线方向。</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-formula-block\" data-mp-block=\"b2\" aria-label=\"留数定理\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">留数定理</p>\n<div class=\"pg-formula-wrap\"><div class=\"pg-formula\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Res</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_C f(z)\\,dz=2\\pi i\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\operatorname{Res}(f,z_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"pg-formula-label\">$C$ 取正向</span></div><span class=\"pg-formula-hint\">左右滑动查看完整公式</span></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-table-block\" data-mp-block=\"b3\" aria-label=\"奇点处理速查\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">奇点处理速查</p>\n<table class=\"pg-table\">\n\n<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">奇点类型</th><th scope=\"col\">留数算法</th><th scope=\"col\">检查点</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>一阶极点</td><td><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{z\\to z_0}(z-z_0)f(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span></td><td>先约分再代入，注意符号</td></tr>\n<tr><td>二阶及以上极点</td><td>求导后代入，注意阶乘</td><td>别漏阶乘与曲线方向</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n<aside class=\"pg-rail\" aria-label=\"图示与速查\">\n\n<section class=\"pg-block pg-summary\" data-mp-block=\"summary\" aria-label=\"本页小结\">\n<div class=\"pg-summary-grid\">\n<div class=\"pg-summary-card\"><h3>记住</h3><ul><li>先判内外，再算留数：圈外奇点一律不贡献</li><li>一阶极点用极限，二阶及以上用导数公式</li><li>负向曲线记得加负号，奇点在曲线上不能直接用</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"pg-summary-card\"><h3>易错</h3><ul><li>把圈外奇点也算进留数，或忘记曲线方向</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"pg-summary-card\"><h3>下一步</h3><p class=\"pg-step-text\">下一讲：泰勒与洛朗展开，先复习收敛半径与展开中心</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pg-quickfacts\">\n<p class=\"pg-label\">本页目标</p>\n<ul><li>能独立判断奇点在不在围道内</li><li>能按一阶极点公式计算留数</li></ul>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<footer class=\"pg-foot\">\n<p class=\"pg-source\">依据：3.3 留数定理 · 设函数在简单闭曲线内除有限个孤立奇点外解析，则积分等于圈内留数之和乘 2πi。</p>\n<div class=\"pg-controls\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn\" data-pg-action=\"prev\">上一页</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn\" data-pg-action=\"reset\">重置</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pg-btn pg-btn-primary\" data-pg-action=\"next\">下一页</button>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>",
